1 0 obj<</Author(TL_Hercules)/CreationDate(D:20261101030118+00'00')/Creator(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Keywords(Fanworks, Explicit, She-Ra and the Princesses of Power \(2018\), Adora/Scorpia \(She-Ra\), Adora \(She-Ra\), Scorpia \(She-Ra\), Plot What Plot/Porn Without Plot, Vaginal Fingering, Cunnilingus, Top!Adora, bottom!Scorpia, Dom/sub, not entirely sure of the implications of dom/sub tags but just in case its there, headcanons of how scorpion sex works, Brief mention of Cannibalism, in which getting stung by scorpia means death by cannibalism, but she doesn't, adora turns into she ra, Pheromones, this is based on my knowledge of how female scorpions kill and eat their mates, i also forgot how she ra works post s3 so, F/F, Choose Not To Use Archive Warnings, you guys know that trope where the tail on a humaniod thing is a sexual body part?, yeah. that's this., that scene where scorpia says "you can't just touch another woman's tail" as inspo, Updated tags:, hell yeah baby im back, more cannibalism talk since we're in scoribaby's pov, in which she-ra and adora are slightly different beings and scorpia is aware of this, The One Where Adorpia Has Sex in the Woods, okay okay ill be serious now, Strap-Ons, Outdoor Sex, Sort of Mating Cycles but not really, i did more research than necessary, yes about scorpions fuck you)/ModDate(D:20261101030118+00'00')/Producer(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Title(Head and Tails)>>
